From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 12:48:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 028/117] dt-bindings: power: supply: add Apple D2365 charger

D2365 contains the J172 charger status and input-limit registers, but
its PMIC child had no binding and spans distinct status and control
windows.

Document the charger child with named reg ranges and its upstream power
supply. Charge-current, charge-voltage and termination programming
remain out of scope.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: fd3db57b29237f4a6a59ae849b49ca3a59eb1067
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml   |  4 ++
 .../power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml     | 72 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 76 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml

